BUF.excerpt:
) Periods of rain and gusty winds through this evening.
) Much colder tonight through Saturday night with a few wet snowflakes possible early Saturday morning.
) An extended period of dry and warmer weather begins Sunday and lasts most of next week.

RLX.excerpt:
) A cold front brings showers, storms, and gusty winds today, followed by colder temperatures and continued breezes tonight.
) Widespread frost/freeze conditions are expected Saturday night into early Sunday morning.
) Quiet weather and a warming trend are expected next week.
